# Internal Brain: local settings and keys (template).
# Copy this file to `databridge/.env.ib.local` and fill in what you use. That file is git-ignored
# (`.env.*.local`) and read only by the Internal Brain process (scripts/demo_up.sh, which
# demo_day.ps1 runs): the keys and IB_CLAUDE* reach only the Brain; the mock platforms, the seeder,
# the engine and the web app start without them.
# Never commit real keys. With no key at all, every answer is quoted from the sources (no model).
#
# Which model answers, in this order:
#   1. Tencent Hunyuan Hy3 through TokenHub, when TOKENHUB_API_KEY is set and TokenHub answers
#      (demo_up.sh runs scripts/hy3_check.py at start and turns it on only if it is live);
#   2. the stand-in model, only when IB_CLAUDE=1 and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY are both set (off by default);
#   3. otherwise the quoted answer, built from the cited sentences.
# Whichever answers, the model sees only passages that passed Gate 1 and the live Gate 2, and the
# grounding check runs on its text. IB_FORCE_OFFLINE=1 turns every model off.

# --- Tencent models (TokenHub) ------------------------------------------------------------------
TOKENHUB_API_KEY=
# Models tried in order (default: hy3,deepseek-v4.1-flash).
# IB_MODELS=hy3,deepseek-v4.1-flash
# Endpoint (default: https://tokenhub-intl.tencentcloudmaas.com/v1).
# TOKENHUB_BASE=https://tokenhub-intl.tencentcloudmaas.com/v1

# --- Optional stand-in model --------------------------------------------------------------------
# An external model used only while Hy3 is not live; off unless IB_CLAUDE=1.
# It writes chat answers and lays out "pages beside the chat". User-facing labels stay neutral ("AI model").
IB_CLAUDE=0
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Hard spend cap in US$, shared by every stand-in call and persisted across restarts (default 10).
# IB_CLAUDE_BUDGET_USD=10
# Effort for page layout and for chat answers (default: low).
# IB_CLAUDE_EFFORT=low
# IB_CLAUDE_ANSWER_EFFORT=low
# Fast mode for page layout (default 1 = on; it costs about twice as much per token).
# IB_CLAUDE_FAST=1
# Calls per person per minute for stand-in chat answers (default 12; pages have the same limit).
# IB_CLAUDE_USER_LIMIT=12

# --- Switches -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1 = no model at all, the stand-in included (deterministic quoted answers). demo_up.sh sets it from hy3_check.py at start.
# IB_FORCE_OFFLINE=1
# Sign-in passcode for a public URL (empty = the local demo sign-in without a passcode).
# IB_DEMO_PASSCODE=
